graphviz.wasm (embedded in github.com/goccy/go-graphviz v0.2.10)

graphviz.wasm is a WebAssembly build of the following components, made by
go-graphviz (see internal/wasm/build/Dockerfile in its repository). dbfolio
distributes it unmodified, in object code form, as part of its binary.

- Graphviz 12.1.2
